                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2609.32472/2609.32472v1/figure/method.png",
                "caption": "Figure 2:Overview of AdaTutoRank.Stage 1(Setwise SFT) generates silver labels from query-specific rubrics and fine-tunes the policy into a cold start for set selection.Stage 2(Adaptive Tutoring Optimization) routes to each rollout a hint matched to its reward, and re-scoring the rollout with and without that hint yields a dense advantage complementing the group-relative outcome signal.",
